      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We propose an extension of the Wasserstein 1-metric (W1) for density matrices, matrix-valued density measures, and an unbalanced interpretation of mass transport. We use duality theory and, in particular, a \"dual of the dual\" formulation of W1. This matrix analogue of the Earth Mover's Distance has several attractive features including ease of computation."},
